# 本仓库只收录 Web3 安全手册和学习站；工作区里的其他目录不进仓库
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/Web3-Security/
!/learning-site/
!/practice-example-code/

# 系统与编辑器
.DS_Store
.claude/

# 依赖与构建缓存
node_modules/
**/practice-example-code/**/lib/
!**/practice-example-code/ops/lib/
**/practice-example-code/**/out/
**/practice-example-code/**/out-*/
**/practice-example-code/**/cache/
**/practice-example-code/**/broadcast/

# 视频成品与媒体（只保留脚本、幻灯片和工具源码）
Web3-Security/video/output/
# 拟物化 / 3b1b 视频工程：成片、字体、配乐只放本地（主 checkout），不入库
Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep*/out
Web3-Security/video/skeuo/**/fonts/
Web3-Security/video/skeuo/**/*.woff2
Web3-Security/video/skeuo/**/*.ttf
Web3-Security/video/skeuo/**/*.mp3
Web3-Security/video/skeuo/**/.hyperframes/
Web3-Security/video/skeuo/**/renders/
Web3-Security/video/skeuo/**/review/
Web3-Security/video/3b1b/output
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.wav
*.mp3
